  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of five years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the units are occupied.",
    "Condition : 3 - The parking, loading and turning spaces shown on drawing No. 01/076/06 shall be constructed and available for use before first occupation of any part of the development and such spaces shall not be used for any other purposes.",
    "Condition : 4 - The use hereby permitted for residential purposes shall not be begun until full particulars and details of a scheme to insulate the premises against the transmission of airborne and impact sound has been submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority and the development shall not be carried out otherwise than in accordance with any approval given."
